Subject: [PATCH 1/2] device: onclite: restore USB gadget after host mode

Add an onclite-only udev helper that binds the existing configfs gadget when DWC3 returns to DEVICE.

Serialize it with the tethering dispatcher and refuse incomplete or mismatched gadget state.

Signed-off-by: Kostiantyn Andriiuk <konstantin@andriyuk.com>
